data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `video-search` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/video-search/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search\npython /mnt/skills/custom/video-search/scripts/run.py --query Trafic --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --labels person,car,bus,truck,motorcycle,bicycle --top-k 5 --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"65ccdae1-42a2-435d-be96-3ec7df239c25"},{"content":"我将严格执行 video-search skill 的真链路测试。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":121,"prompt_tokens":9376,"total_tokens":9497,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":49,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":121},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9376}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-6d9c2a5f-f388-92ae-8f2a-66f785bae2e1","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e637e-bdc4-7463-b329-40dbcdf6fe0e-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 video-search skill 的 SKILL.md 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video-search/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_90875be28a484ff597ed1c2d","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9376,"output_tokens":121,"total_tokens":9497,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":49}}},{"content":"---\nname: video-search\ndescription: Search indexed monitoring videos in Elasticsearch by keyword, camera, time range, object labels, event type, location, and optional precomputed query vectors. Use after videos have been ingested into the video library.\n---\n\n# Video Search\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nUse structured filters when the user names a camera, time window, object class, event type, or video id. Use `--query` for natural-language or keyword search. Use `--query-vector-json` only when the user provides a precomputed vector.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython video-search/scripts/run.py --query \"person near gate\" --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --top-k 10 --index citybrain-video-library --config <config.json> --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--query`, `--index`, `--camera-id`, `--start-time`, `--end-time`, `--labels`, `--event-type`, `--query-vector-json`, `--top-k`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Connect to Elasticsearch using `ES_URL`, `ES_USERNAME`, and `ES_PASSWORD` or explicit config fallback.\n2. Build bool filters for camera, time, labels, and event type.\n3. Use keyword search over `content_text`, `filename`, location fields, and metadata.\n4. If a query vector is provided and the index has a `vector` field, use vector scoring; otherwise fall back to keyword and filters.\n5. Return compact hits with scores and source metadata.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `hits`, `total`, `query_mode`, and `index`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- `INDEX_NOT_FOUND`\n\n## Constraints\n\nThis skill retrieves indexed video records. It does not ingest videos, run object detection, infer events, or generate evidence packages.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"223ea023-d33e-4bf7-8780-16ac3c764079","tool_call_id":"call_90875be28a484ff597ed1c2d","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"已成功读取 SKILL.md 文件。现在执行 bash 命令运行 video-search skill 的入口脚本。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":161,"prompt_tokens":9907,"total_tokens":10068,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":161},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9907}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-e59abc54-f05d-9f1c-ab61-0df78feac574","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e637e-f08f-7473-b097-95ac90f9a7ae-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 video-search skill 的 run.py 脚本","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search\npython /mnt/skills/custom/video-search/scripts/run.py --query Trafic --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --labels person,car,bus,truck,motorcycle,bicycle --top-k 5 --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json"},"id":"call_ce70579e06724660a17da31e","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9907,"output_tokens":161,"total_tokens":10068,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"Command failed: 'ErrorObservation' object has no attribute 'exit_code'","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"1309e389-0784-4e32-9096-939cc90bdbab","tool_call_id":"call_ce70579e06724660a17da31e","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"执行命令时出现了错误。让我重新执行这个 bash 命令。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":153,"prompt_tokens":10098,"total_tokens":10251,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio